<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>TERANGA FOOT | Le football sénégalais</title>
<meta name="description" content="Toute l'actualité de la Ligue 1 et de la Ligue 2 sénégalaises.">
<style>
:root{
 --green:#087448;--dark:#071c15;--gold:#e9c65b;
 --light:#f3f6f3;--white:#fff;--muted:#819087;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--light);color:#15251c}
a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
.topbar{background:#04140e;color:#d9e7dc;padding:9px 6%;
 font-size:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
header{background:#09281c;color:white;padding:18px 6%;
 display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
 position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;box-shadow:0 4px 20px #0003}
.logo{font-size:25px;font-weight:900;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:1px}
.logo span{color:white}
nav{display:flex;gap:23px;align-items:center}
nav a{font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;transition:.3s}
nav a:hover{color:var(--gold)}
.menu-btn{display:none;background:none;border:0;color:white;font-size:25px}
.hero{min-height:490px;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;
 background:linear-gradient(90deg,#041c12 5%,#041c12dd 48%,transparent),
 url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522778119026-d647f0596c20?w=1600') center/cover}
.hero-content{padding:65px 7%;max-width:720px;color:white;animation:appear 1s ease}
.kicker{color:var(--gold);font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:3px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(35px,6vw,65px);line-height:1.05;margin:20px 0}
.hero p{color:#dce9e0;line-height:1.8;max-width:510px}
.btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:25px;background:var(--gold);
 color:#14251b;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:5px;font-weight:bold;
 transition:.3s}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 8px 20px #0004}
.ticker{background:var(--green);color:white;padding:13px 6%;
 display:flex;gap:22px;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;font-size:13px}
.ticker strong{color:var(--gold)}
.container{padding:55px 6%;max-width:1500px;margin:auto}
.section-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
 margin-bottom:25px;gap:15px}
.section-head h2{font-size:27px}
.section-head h2 span{color:var(--green)}
.section-head a{font-size:13px;color:var(--green);font-weight:bold}
.news-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr 1fr;gap:19px}
.news-card{background:white;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;
 box-shadow:0 5px 20px #15251c0d;transition:.35s}
.news-card:hover{transform:translateY(-7px);box-shadow:0 12px 30px #15251c20}
.news-image{height:205px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.news-image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:.5s}
.news-card:hover img{transform:scale(1.07)}
.news-card.featured .news-image{height:270px}
.category{position:absolute;bottom:12px;left:12px;background:var(--green);
 color:white;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:3px;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold}
.news-body{padding:19px}
.news-body small{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}
.news-body h3{font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;margin:10px 0}
.news-body p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#66736b}
.leagues{background:#09281c;color:white}
.league-tabs{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:25px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.tab{padding:12px 20px;border:1px solid #547361;background:transparent;
 color:white;border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold}
.tab.active{background:var(--gold);color:#14251b;border-color:var(--gold)}
.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;background:white;color:#1c2b22;border-radius:9px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:510px}
th{background:#e9f1eb;color:#315540;text-align:left;padding:15px;font-size:12px}
td{padding:15px;border-bottom:1px solid #edf0ed;font-size:13px}
tr:hover td{background:#f3f8f4}
.position{font-weight:bold;color:var(--green)}
.fixture-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
.match{background:white;padding:23px;border-radius:9px;text-align:center;
 box-shadow:0 5px 20px #00000009}
.match small{color:var(--muted)}
.teams{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-around;
 margin:22px 0;font-weight:bold}
.teams span{font-size:13px}
.vs{color:var(--green);font-size:19px;font-weight:900}
.match-label{background:#eaf3ed;color:var(--green);padding:7px 12px;
 border-radius:20px;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold}
.club-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}
.club{background:white;border-radius:10px;padding:25px;text-align:center;
 transition:.3s;box-shadow:0 5px 20px #00000009}
.club:hover{transform:translateY(-6px)}
.club-logo{width:76px;height:76px;border-radius:50%;margin:auto auto 15px;
 background:linear-gradient(135deg,#087448,#e9c65b);display:grid;
 place-items:center;color:white;font-size:27px;font-weight:900}
.club h3{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:6px}
.club small{color:var(--muted)}
.banner{margin:15px 6%;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;
 background:linear-gradient(90deg,#052316eF,#05231688),
 url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1431324155629-1a6deb1dec8d?w=1400') center/cover;
 padding:55px;color:white}
.banner h2{font-size:32px;margin-bottom:12px}
.banner p{color:#d7e6dc;line-height:1.7}
footer{background:#04140e;color:white;padding:45px 6% 20px}
.footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr;gap:30px}
footer h3{color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:15px}
footer p,footer a{font-size:13px;color:#b8c9be;line-height:2}
footer a{display:block}
.copyright{border-top:1px solid #294235;margin-top:30px;padding-top:20px;
 text-align:center;color:#9eafa4;font-size:12px}
@keyframes appear{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(25px)}
 to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
@media(max-width:850px){
 nav{display:none;position:absolute;top:100%;left:0;width:100%;
 background:#09281c;padding:22px;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}
 nav.open{display:flex}
 .menu-btn{display:block}
 .news-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
 .news-card.featured{grid-column:span 2}
 .club-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
 .fixture-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
}
@media(max-width:550px){
 .topbar{font-size:10px}
 .hero{min-height:430px;background-position:60% center}
 .hero-content{padding:45px 6%}
 .container{padding:40px 5%}
 .news-grid,.fixture-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .news-card.featured{grid-column:auto}
 .club-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
 .section-head h2{font-size:21px}
 .banner{margin:10px 5%;padding:35px 22px}
 .banner h2{font-size:25px}
 .footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
<span>🇸🇳 LE FOOTBALL SÉNÉGALAIS À LA UNE</span>
<span>PASSION • TALENT • FIERTÉ</span>
</div>

<header>
<div class="logo">TERANGA <span>FOOT.</span></div>
<button class="menu-btn" onclick="document.querySelector('nav').classList.toggle('open')">☰</button>
<nav>
<a href="#accueil">ACCUEIL</a>
<a href="#actualites">ACTUALITÉS</a>
<a href="#ligues">LIGUE 1</a>
<a href="#ligues">LIGUE 2</a>
<a href="#matchs">MATCHS</a>
<a href="#clubs">CLUBS</a>
</nav>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="accueil">
<div class="hero-content">
<div class="kicker">LA MAISON DU FOOTBALL SÉNÉGALAIS</div>
<h1>NOTRE FOOTBALL.<br>NOTRE FIERTÉ.</h1>
<p>Découvrez toute la richesse de la Ligue 1 et de la Ligue 2 sénégalaises. Les clubs, les joueurs, les résultats et les histoires qui font vibrer notre championnat.</p>
<a href="#actualites" class="btn">DÉCOUVRIR L'ACTUALITÉ →</a>
</div>
</section>

<div class="ticker">
<strong>TERANGA FOOT</strong>
<span>⚽ Valorisons nos championnats</span>
<span>🏆 Révélons nos talents</span>
<span>🇸🇳 Faisons rayonner le football sénégalais</span>
</div>

<section class="container" id="actualites">
<div class="section-head">
<h2>À LA <span>UNE</span></h2>
<a href="#clubs">TOUTES LES RUBRIQUES →</a>
</div>
<div class="news-grid">
<article class="news-card featured">
<div class="news-image">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574629810360-7efbbe195018?w=1000" alt="Terrain de football">
<span class="category">FOOTBALL SÉNÉGALAIS</span>
</div>
<div class="news-body">
<small>TERANGA FOOT • À LA UNE</small>
<h3>Le championnat sénégalais au cœur de notre passion</h3>
<p>Retrouvez les actualités, les performances et les histoires de nos clubs et de nos joueurs.</p>
</div>
</article>
<article class="news-card">
<div class="news-image">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1431324155629-1a6deb1dec8d?w=700" alt="Action de football">
<span class="category">LIGUE 1</span>
</div>
<div class="news-body">
<small>CHAMPIONNAT • DOSSIER</small>
<h3>Les talents de notre football à découvrir</h3>
<p>Les joueurs qui font vivre les terrains sénégalais.</p>
</div>
</article>
<article class="news-card">
<div class="news-image">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522778119026-d647f0596c20?w=700" alt="Stade de football">
<span class="category">LIGUE 2</span>
</div>
<div class="news-body">
<small>CHAMPIONNAT • DÉCOUVERTE</small>
<h3>La deuxième division mérite aussi la lumière</h3>
<p>Les clubs et les ambitions de la Ligue 2 sénégalaise.</p>
</div>
</article>
</div>
</section>

<section class="leagues" id="ligues">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-head">
<h2 style="color:white">NOS <span>CHAMPIONNATS</span></h2>
</div>
<div class="league-tabs">
<button class="tab active" onclick="showLeague('l1',this)">LIGUE 1</button>
<button class="tab" onclick="showLeague('l2',this)">LIGUE 2</button>
</div>
<div id="l1" class="table-wrap">
<table>
<thead><tr><th>POS.</th><th>CLUB</th><th>PTS</th><th>STATUT</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="position">01</td><td>Club à renseigner</td><td>—</td><td>À actualiser</td></tr>
<tr><td class="position">02</td><td>Club à renseigner</td><td>—</td><td>À actualiser</td></tr>
<tr><td class="position">03</td><td>Club à renseigner</td><td>—</td><td>À actualiser</td></tr>
<tr><td class="position">04</td><td>Club à renseigner</td><td>—</td><td>À actualiser</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
</div>
<div id="l2" class="table-wrap" style="display:none">
<table>
<thead><tr><th>POS.</th><th>CLUB</th><th>PTS</th><th>STATUT</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="position">01</td><td>Club à renseigner</td><td>—</td><td>À actualiser</td></tr>
<tr><td class="position">02</td><td>Club à renseigner</td><td>—</td><td>À actualiser</td></tr>
<tr><td class="position">03</td><td>Club à renseigner</td><td>—</td><td>À actualiser</td></tr>
<tr><td class="position">04</td><td>Club à renseigner</td><td>—</td><td>À actualiser</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
</div>
<p style="font-size:12px;color:#b9cfc1;margin-top:15px">Données de démonstration : les classements officiels seront ajoutés et actualisés.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="container" id="matchs">
<div class="section-head">
<h2>LES <span>RENCONTRES</span></h2>
<a href="#ligues">CALENDRIERS →</a>
</div>
<div class="fixture-grid">
<div class="match"><small>LIGUE 1 • PROCHAINE JOURNÉE</small>
<div class="teams"><span>ÉQUIPE A</span><span class="vs">VS</span><span>ÉQUIPE B</span></div>
<span class="match-label">DATE À CONFIRMER</span></div>
<div class="match"><small>LIGUE 1 • PROCHAINE JOURNÉE</small>
<div class="teams"><span>ÉQUIPE C</span><span class="vs">VS</span><span>ÉQUIPE D</span></div>
<span class="match-label">DATE À CONFIRMER</span></div>
<div class="match"><small>LIGUE 2 • PROCHAINE JOURNÉE</small>
<div class="teams"><span>ÉQUIPE E</span><span class="vs">VS</span><span>ÉQUIPE F</span></div>
<span class="match-label">DATE À CONFIRMER</span></div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="container" id="clubs">
<div class="section-head">
<h2>LES <span>CLUBS</span></h2>
<a href="#ligues">DÉCOUVRIR →</a>
</div>
<div class="club-grid">
<div class="club"><div class="club-logo">L1</div><h3>Ligue 1</h3><small>Clubs de l'élite</small></div>
<div class="club"><div class="club-logo">L2</div><h3>Ligue 2</h3><small>Clubs de deuxième division</small></div>
<div class="club"><div class="club-logo">⭐</div><h3>Nos talents</h3><small>Joueurs à découvrir</small></div>
<div class="club"><div class="club-logo">🏆</div><h3>Palmarès</h3><small>Histoire du championnat</small></div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="banner">
<div class="kicker">ENSEMBLE POUR NOTRE FOOTBALL</div>
<h2>LE SÉNÉGAL A DU TALENT.</h2>
<p>Notre championnat mérite une grande vitrine.<br>Teranga Foot est là pour le mettre en lumière.</p>
<a href="#actualites" class="btn">EXPLORER TERANGA FOOT →</a>
</section>

<footer>
<div class="footer-grid">
<div><h3>🇸🇳 TERANGA FOOT</h3>
<p>La plateforme dédiée à la promotion de la Ligue 1 et de la Ligue 2 sénégalaises. Notre football, notre fierté.</p></div>
<div><h3>CHAMPIONNATS</h3>
<a href="#ligues">Ligue 1 sénégalaise</a>
<a href="#ligues">Ligue 2 sénégalaise</a>
<a href="#matchs">Calendrier des matchs</a></div>
<div><h3>EXPLORER</h3>
<a href="#actualites">Actualités</a>
<a href="#clubs">Clubs et joueurs</a>
<a href="#accueil">Accueil</a></div>
</div>
<div class="copyright">© 2026 TERANGA FOOT • Le football sénégalais mérite la lumière.</div>
</footer>

<script>
function showLeague(id,button){
 document.getElementById('l1').style.display=id==='l1'?'block':'none';
 document.getElementById('l2').style.display=id==='l2'?'block':'none';
 document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(t=>t.classList.remove('active'));
 button.classList.add('active');
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
